model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 R13 (#197): windows each takes the window its plain line's hole names, the first its reads met. c3n's text: two movements dated by windows around 2026-03-06, a third in May (t2: heads [w1, w2], never w3); an or that stops early (x2); a key read through a window (n1 plain, n2); no-item 1, solve per sub-window (sv); no-item 2, inputs-of per tuple and sub-window (io); #169-d, a binding over movements binds inside each run (sb); no-item 4 and #191 Q4, explain per derivation and beyond the pins (ex, exp); no-item 5's twin, one line per binding tuple where values are equal (fk)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index ks = [ka, kb]
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input w1: date
input w2: date
input w3: date
input a: date
input b[d in days]: date
input y: money PLN
input goal: money PLN
input cutoff: date
input wk[k in ks]: date
input vv[k in ks]: int

def early[k in ks]: bool
  rule base = wk[k] < cutoff

move m1: transfers
  on w1
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

move m2: transfers
  on w2
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

move m3: transfers
  on w3
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w1 = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) "s"
  w2 = window(2026-03-06, 2026-03-08) "s"
  w3 = window(2026-05-01, 2026-05-03) "s"
  a = window(2026-03-01, 2026-03-02) "s"
  b[2026-03-01] = window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-02) "s"
  b[2026-03-02] = 2026-05-01 "s"
  y = 0.00 PLN "s"
  goal = 250.00 PLN "s"
  cutoff = 2026-03-06 "s"
  wk[ka] = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) "s"
  wk[kb] = 2026-03-01 "s"
  vv[ka] = 1 "s"
  vv[kb] = 1 "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask t1: bal(konto, 2026-03-06)
ask t2: bal(konto, 2026-03-06) windows each
ask x1: (w1 < 2026-03-06) or (w2 > 2026-03-07)
ask x2: (w1 < 2026-03-06) or (w2 > 2026-03-07) windows each
ask n1: b[a] > 2026-04-01
ask n2: b[a] > 2026-04-01 windows each
ask sv: solve bal(konto, 2026-03-06) + y == goal for y in [0 PLN, 1000 PLN] to 0.01 PLN windows each
ask io: inputs-of early[k] for k in ks windows each
ask sb: sum(t.cash.amount for t in transfers over 2026-03-05 .. 2026-03-07) windows each
ask ex: explain bal(konto, 2026-03-06) windows each
ask exp: explain bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with w1 = 2026-03-05 windows each
ask fk: vv[k] for k in ks
